  {
    "id": "anno-tsushima_upper_p013_left-03",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但本藩年租籾六百七拾五石六斗八升一合六夕七才米ニ直シ如是"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、本藩の年租粗（あら）六百七十五石六斗八升一合六夕七才、米に直（なお）し如是（かくのごとし）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: the domain's annual land tax as unhulled rice, 675.68167 koku, when converted to hulled rice is as follows."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "但書 (note on rice total / conversion)"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
