      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、九州管轄所（きゅうしゅうかんかつしょ）の年租、五ケ年平均の現米（げんまい）如是（かくのごとし）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: the five-year average of the annual land tax collected as hulled rice for the Kyushu jurisdiction is as follows."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "但書 (note: five-year average hulled-rice tax, Kyushu jurisdiction)"
