  {
    "id": "anno-tsushima_upper_p013_left-07",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但本藩麥七千貳百拾八石五斗九升六合七夕四才／石六兩二見積"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、本藩の麥（むぎ）七千二百十八石五斗九升六合七夕四才、石（こく）に付き六両二（分）と見積（みつも）る"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: the domain's barley, 7,218.59674 koku, reckoned at 6 ryō 2 [bu] per koku."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "但書 (note: barley valued at 6 ryō 2 per koku)"
