    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但下毛宇佐本途ノ大豆千八百六拾二石壹斗壹升九合八夕／石六兩二見積凡如是"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、下毛（しもつみけ）・宇佐（うさ）本途（ほんと）の大豆（だいず）千八百六十二石一斗一升九合八夕、石に付き六両二（分）と見積り、凡（およ）そ如是（かくのごとし）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: the soybean from the Shimotsumike-Usa main-route lands, 1,862.1198 koku, reckoned at 6 ryō 2 [bu] per koku, roughly as follows."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "但書 (note: Shimotsumike-Usa mainland soybean valued at 6 ryō 2 per koku)"
